abstract: "8044-byte standalone kernel implementing a persistent monotonic counter at physical address 0x7E00. Maintains temporal continuity across host reboots and provides externally verifiable timestamps via Bitcoin OTS anchoring. Independent timing domain, read-only attestation interface."
